{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Yorkie14MemoryDocStoreC8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"docKey","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}]}]},{"name":"bytes","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The serialized header."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"log","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"serverSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":", so a restore reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the underlying storage raises.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MemoryDocStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that keeps documents in memory for the lifetime of the process.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocStore"}],"title":"DocStore","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocStore"}],"type":"topic"}}}